> thing like:  1000 + random(0-4000) + luck-based random(0-2000).  

Didn't SLASH'EM at one time have timed-out intrinsics that were
removed after much complaining?

> 	Strength above 18 times out.

Too vicious.

> 	The magic cancellation from armor should drop by one for
