Or more simply, only undamaged armor grants cancellation.

Another simple area of change (touched on in other posts in
the tread) is to make higher level monsters nastier. Elemental
powers of unique monsters are only halved by resistance. Purple
worms do massive acid digestive damage. TOUGHVLAD (minus
stoning ;). Etc.

